{"id": "20446bcf-9624-4c65-bbc2-23a8b7a73b57", "name": "水蒸気漏れ量算出制約", "description": "ピンホール径、ピンホール長さ、平均圧力、粘性係数、差圧から水蒸気の漏れ量を算出するハーゲン・ポアズイユ式。", "inputNames": ["D", "L", "P_avg", "eta", "dP"], "outputNames": ["Q_H2O"], "parameters": {}, "code": "pi = 3.141592653589793\nQ_H2O = (pi / 128) * (D**4 / L) * (P_avg / eta) * dP", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T11:58:11.051105", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
