{"id": "90989f74-f698-4b5e-bd5b-52033a456d7b", "name": "電極体温度上昇制約", "description": "電極体の発熱量と熱抵抗から、熱平衡状態における電極体の温度上昇値を算出します。", "inputNames": ["heat_generation", "thermal_resistance"], "outputNames": ["temperature_rise"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# 発熱量と熱抵抗から、電極体の温度上昇（雰囲気温度に対する上昇分）を算出する\ntemperature_rise = heat_generation * thermal_resistance", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T12:01:57.206830", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
